{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Sheet Music Catalogue 是專為音樂家打造的個人樂譜庫存管理工具。無論您的樂譜存放於琴凳、檔案櫃或書架，此 App 能將其轉化為井然有序且可搜尋的目錄。它協助鋼琴家、弦樂手及教師快速定位曲目，避免重複購買，並記錄練習與演出歷程。現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>全自動樂譜目錄整理</h2>\n<p>用戶可詳細錄入曲名、作曲家、難度及樂器配置，並按書籍分組。其特點功能在於輸入書籍資訊後，App 能線上識別該版本實際曲目列表，經確認後一鍵批量添加，大幅減少手動輸入時間。此外，支援標記最愛、統計收藏分佈、離線使用及數據備份導出，無廣告訂閱，確保數據私隱安全，適合各類音樂學習者與教學者使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-730-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-731-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-732-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-733-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-734-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-735-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Sheet Music Catalogue</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T11:18:34.518387+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}